{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are captured gray aliens sent by a mysterious organization into the depths of Subject &quot;The Maze&quot;, the creation of the horrifying creature Maze Creep...<br><br>Maze Creep!! is a horror satire, where players explore procedurally generated mazes evading the all-hearing Maze Creep, as well as a large cast of other monsters. Collect resources in the maze to give yourself and your friends a better fighting chance. If your friends die, be sure to collect their revival orb, or be penalized. If you all die, you lose.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mazes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large cast of enemies with a huge variety of behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaks between the mazes where you can revive your friends, buy from the shopkeeper Mr. Long One, and other activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous deaths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprisingly dark lore...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014040?t=1758335533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014040?t=1758335533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014040/143471826ebad76030bae42c33c18f8c84547ee0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758335533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014040/143471826ebad76030bae42c33c18f8c84547ee0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758335533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Player characters can die in cartoonishly brutal ways, including frequent dismemberment and decapitation. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends are captured gray aliens sent by a mysterious organization into the depths of Subject &quot;The Maze&quot;, the creation of the horrifying creature Maze Creep...<br><br>Maze Creep!! is a horror satire, where players explore procedurally generated mazes evading the all-hearing Maze Creep, as well as a large cast of other monsters. Collect resources in the maze to give yourself and your friends a better fighting chance. If your friends die, be sure to collect their revival orb, or be penalized. If you all die, you lose.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated mazes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large cast of enemies with a huge variety of behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaks between the mazes where you can revive your friends, buy from the shopkeeper Mr. Long One, and other activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous deaths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprisingly dark lore...</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bosskiller Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014040/b775345d8a44877d02fcc797b23d43ae57a2b35c/header.jpg?t=1758335533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4014040/92679550/fe417f947097acde578711f7656be4d41c2171f5/1757996836/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758335529","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4014040/92679550/fe417f947097acde578711f7656be4d41c2171f5/1757996836/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758335529","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4014040/92679550/fe417f947097acde